WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.790
<b>I'm Going to Save This World!!</b>

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.790
<b>Takada Mirai</b>

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:10.400
<b>Zoom</b>

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:14.010
<b>Ka-Pow</b>

00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:16.010
<b>Aaaaaa
aaaaaa
aaaaaa
aaaaah</b>

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:20.240
Wh-Why are you doing this? For me?

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:24.710
If I defeat him... you will be...

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:25.850
...free!

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:29.980
G-Gah! Why?!

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.150
S-Spare me!

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:33.920
<b>Gah</b>

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:37.180
Don't rob people of the things...

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:40.930
Dun dun dun

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:39.290
...they hold dear!

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:46.400
Your work this week is amazing 
once again, Ozaki-kun!

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:50.560
But you do need to get the manuscript up
in the morning at the latest.

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:51.720
I'm not going to be late.

00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:54.090
I have my pride.

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:33.040
<b>#06</b>

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:33.040
<b>Ozaki-kun Has His Pride</b>

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:33.040
<b>I'm Going to 
Save This World!!</b>

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:38.300
<b>I'm Going to 
Save This World!!</b>

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:41.620
Holy crap, this is good!

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:45.310
"Don't rob people of the things 
they hold dear!"

00:02:45.940 --> 00:02:48.700
Dude, you're so slow to come to the rescue!

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:52.420
Is that manga fun?

00:02:55.420 --> 00:02:58.020
In my view, it's easily number one.

00:02:58.020 --> 00:03:00.020
<i>I'm Going to Save This World!!</i>

00:03:00.020 --> 00:03:02.820
already has over 10 million copies in print!

00:03:01.380 --> 00:03:05.030
<b>I'm Going to 
Save This World!!</b>

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:05.030
An anime adaptation
has already been greenlit, too.

00:03:05.030 --> 00:03:09.890
Of course, I foresaw its success
right from chapter one.

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:13.180
You know, if you want, you can borrow it!

00:03:14.140 --> 00:03:16.730
No, I'm fine.

00:03:16.730 --> 00:03:17.540
That so?

00:03:18.220 --> 00:03:19.330
All right, then.

00:03:23.950 --> 00:03:25.170
What is it?

00:03:25.170 --> 00:03:27.000
How long are you going to stand there?

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:28.060
I can't read like this!

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:32.920
I see.

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:35.840
What's going on, four eyes?

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:38.940
Nothing. It's just that Ozaki
actually talked to me for once.

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:43.950
He's always by himself,
so it's hard to know what he's really like.

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:45.690
It's Ozaki-kun!

00:03:55.880 --> 00:03:58.070
There he goes.

00:03:58.070 --> 00:04:00.180
How I've missed this feeling.

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:08.250
Ozaki-kun always looks intently at things 
that catch his attention, doesn't he?

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:10.050
Right now, it's a wall.

00:04:10.050 --> 00:04:11.520
I wonder why.

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:16.020
Usually, that kinda stare would be creepy,
but when it's Ozaki-kun,

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:18.410
it gives you goosebumps!

00:04:18.410 --> 00:04:21.030
What's wrong with you?!

00:04:21.340 --> 00:04:22.770
What's going on?

00:04:22.770 --> 00:04:25.960
The math teacher, Katahira,
is throwing a fit again!

00:04:25.960 --> 00:04:28.030
Who's the victim this time?

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:31.380
Bringing manga to school 
is against the rules!

00:04:31.380 --> 00:04:32.130
Confiscated!

00:04:32.130 --> 00:04:36.170
Please wait! Everybody brings manga to school!

00:04:36.550 --> 00:04:38.320
A rule violation is a rule violation.

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:39.820
I don't like excuses.

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:46.430
No! Wait!

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:48.550
Manga's a complete waste of time.

00:04:49.170 --> 00:04:52.060
If you have time for that junk,
use it to study more!

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:54.250
She didn't have to rip it.

00:04:54.250 --> 00:04:56.690
That was actually cruel.

00:04:58.230 --> 00:05:00.700
I hadn't finished reading it yet!

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:05.570
Worst day ever!

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:09.530
And what kind of woman
goes after someone else's boyfriend?

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:12.080
I'm sorry! Teehee!

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:15.210
Ma-kun

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:15.210
<b>I've fallen in love 
with someone else</b>

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:15.210
Ma-kun

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:15.210
<b>...I'm sorry</b>

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:15.730
That thieving cat!

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:18.080
Cat?

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:22.340
Wait, what's all this?
 I just washed it yesterday!

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:36.350
There are more now.

00:05:39.430 --> 00:05:41.220
So you're the culprit.

00:05:42.970 --> 00:05:45.730
I'm going to get them taken 
to the pound immediately.

00:05:45.730 --> 00:05:46.610
Huh?

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:47.940
But that's...

00:05:46.760 --> 00:05:51.390
<b>Aoyama Life</b>

00:05:47.940 --> 00:05:49.960
If you're against it, you take them home...

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:53.400
M-My parents are both allergic 
to cats, so I can't do that.

00:05:53.400 --> 00:05:57.240
Blame yourself for feeding them
when you're not ready to take them in.

00:05:57.420 --> 00:05:58.650
This is on you.

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:05.380
Hello? I'm calling from Fujimi High School.

00:06:06.170 --> 00:06:07.380
Yes. It's about some cats.

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:12.390
<i>What do I do?
They'll be taken away because of me!</i>

00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:16.020
Please come immediately. Yes.

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:18.780
<i>I need to do something...</i>

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:21.810
<b>Aoyama Life</b>

00:06:20.620 --> 00:06:21.810
<i>Anything.</i>

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:25.580
Okay, stop.

00:06:26.570 --> 00:06:27.670
Huh?

00:06:28.760 --> 00:06:29.320
Hey!

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:31.130
What are you doing?!

00:06:32.130 --> 00:06:34.070
What was that for?!

00:06:34.070 --> 00:06:36.830
These are my cats.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:37.820
See you.

00:06:38.260 --> 00:06:42.840
W-Wait! You'd better pay for my phone!

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:44.140
You hear me?!

00:06:44.810 --> 00:06:47.910
Then what about that manga 
you tore up earlier?

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:55.010
Don't rob people of the things 
they hold dear.

00:06:55.970 --> 00:06:58.730
That thieving cat!

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:06.280
I didn't throw it.

00:07:06.590 --> 00:07:07.610
Ozaki-kun...

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:14.530
<b>Aoyama Life</b>

00:07:10.620 --> 00:07:12.430
You acted so tough.

00:07:12.430 --> 00:07:14.530
Bye-bye, kitties.

00:07:15.250 --> 00:07:17.360
Sorry for the wait, Naga-san.

00:07:17.360 --> 00:07:21.630
You're so late, Ozaki-kun—whoa!
What's with those meow-meows?!

00:07:21.630 --> 00:07:22.670
I found them.

00:07:23.570 --> 00:07:25.170
We have to get right down to work

00:07:25.640 --> 00:07:29.130
and send the manuscript before morning,
or we'll be in trouble.

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:30.220
Roger.

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:31.760
<b>Edge</b>

00:07:33.130 --> 00:07:35.230
I shouldn't have done that.

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:40.600
<b>Don't rob 
people 
of the things
they hold
dear!!</b>

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:40.600
<b>Books 1-9 
on sale now!</b>

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:40.600
<b>Takada's latest works are only
 available in the Weekly Gonz!</b>

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:40.600
<b>Takada 
Mirai</b>

00:07:36.410 --> 00:07:40.600
"Don't rob people of the things 
they hold dear," huh?

00:07:41.380 --> 00:07:44.610
This manga kinda reminds me of Ozaki-kun.

00:07:45.050 --> 00:07:47.610
Did something good happen today?

00:07:47.950 --> 00:07:49.340
Not really.

00:07:50.140 --> 00:07:51.110
I see.

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:55.120
School's the best place to
get inspiration for shounen manga.

00:07:55.850 --> 00:07:58.370
Make sure you take in everything.

00:07:58.710 --> 00:08:02.000
Actually, there <i>is</i> someone who's on my mind.

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:11.130
<b>Rescue complete!</b>

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:10.480
So good!

00:08:11.640 --> 00:08:13.810
I want to read <i>Save the World,</i> so gimme.

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:15.760
Sure thing.

00:08:16.420 --> 00:08:20.340
This week, Matsu Suguru 
saves a village of cats!

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:25.170
You moron! No spoilers, four eyes!

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:26.900
Then buy them yourself for once!

00:08:27.300 --> 00:08:29.880
I'm eating your lunches, all right?

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:30.900
Wait!

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:31.540
I won't.

00:08:31.540 --> 00:08:34.400
He's chowing down on them!

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:36.030
He's not here.

00:08:40.310 --> 00:08:42.290
<b>Aoyama Life</b>

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:47.170
<b>Aoyama Life</b>

00:08:44.090 --> 00:08:47.170
Is he making her clean?

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:56.040
Which Aoyama-kun do you want next?

00:08:57.350 --> 00:09:00.060
Hm, the Aoyama-kun cleat wiener.

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:01.510
Shoot!

00:09:01.960 --> 00:09:02.810
Okay.

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:06.810
Yurippe, your lunches are 
the best in the world!

00:09:06.810 --> 00:09:08.180
Oh you, Gaku.

00:09:08.180 --> 00:09:09.950
It's true!

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:11.940
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:09:16.350 --> 00:09:20.780
A perfect interception! So amazingly clean!

00:09:20.780 --> 00:09:24.200
<b>I ♥ Aoyama</b>

00:09:20.780 --> 00:09:24.770
Go, go, Aoyama!

00:09:24.770 --> 00:09:28.580
Aoyama-kun, please use this!

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:32.750
<b>I ♥ Aoyama</b>

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:32.750
He's so cool!

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:35.510
<b>I ♥ Aoyama</b>

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:35.510
<b>I ♥ Aoyama</b>

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:35.510
So that type of guy is in, huh?

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:37.760
Here comes the nice D!

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:40.640
It crossed the line! Throw-in!

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:43.610
Aoyama, I'll take it.

00:09:43.610 --> 00:09:44.930
No, I will.

00:09:45.320 --> 00:09:47.780
<i>He's bossing upperclassmen around?</i>

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:51.570
<b>I ♥ Aoyama</b>

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:51.570
Eek! Aoyama-kun! Good luck!

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:54.070
At least wave to them.

00:10:02.890 --> 00:10:05.170
Control! Control! Control!

00:10:06.520 --> 00:10:08.040
Aoyama-sama!

00:10:16.570 --> 00:10:17.070
<b>Step</b>

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:22.340
Watch out, Suguru.
Something's off about this town.

00:10:22.340 --> 00:10:25.350
Yeah, it's enveloped in an aura of negativity.

00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:30.690
The townsfolk are cleaning
with their eyes dead?

00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:31.730
Clean, clean.

00:10:32.120 --> 00:10:34.160
Is somebody controlling them with an ability?

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:35.360
It can't be...

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:38.240
You're...

00:10:40.300 --> 00:10:42.120
The hell-fiend of the wizarding world:

00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:45.990
The Blue Wizard!

00:10:43.390 --> 00:10:45.990
<b>Dun</b>

00:10:45.990 --> 00:10:47.660
Vanish, stain!

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:49.870
What?!

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:52.380
None of these people want to do this!

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:57.470
A real man doesn't avoid getting
his hands dirty by using others!

00:10:57.470 --> 00:11:01.890
The weak desire to be 
controlled by someone strong.

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:03.600
I am strong.

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:06.760
That's why I control the world as it desires!

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:09.520
<b>I am strong.</b>

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:09.520
<b>That's why
I control
the world
as it desires!</b>

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:11.650
So the new character is a villain...

00:11:14.170 --> 00:11:16.020
So cool!

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:20.040
"I am strong. That's why I control."

00:11:23.820 --> 00:11:27.040
<b>I'm Going to 
Save This World!!</b>

00:11:23.820 --> 00:11:27.040
<b>Ozaki Atsumu</b>

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:30.120
<b>I'm the
 protagonist 
of the series!!</b>

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:30.120
<b>Matsu Suguru</b>

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:30.120
<b>Darbobble</b>

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:30.120
<b>Blue Wizard</b>

00:11:31.030 --> 00:11:35.500
Wow, the feedback on this new 
Blue Wizard character has been great!

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:37.570
Looks like he's a real hit!

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:43.760
<b>I'm Going to 
Save This World!!</b>

00:11:37.570 --> 00:11:42.520
Aoyam—I mean, the wizard is 
a selfish villain who controls people!

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:46.950
I guess maybe a lot of people 
view him as an anti-hero?

00:11:46.950 --> 00:11:49.590
Whatever the case, it's good
 that the character is popular.

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:52.520
That was not my intention.

00:11:53.210 --> 00:11:56.730
<i>If that didn't get my point across, 
I'm going to make him even more evil!</i>

00:11:57.130 --> 00:11:57.750
<b>Menacing</b>

00:11:57.130 --> 00:12:01.170
Wah, he's come back!

00:12:01.170 --> 00:12:03.030
Wizard-sama!

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:07.030
Love, love, <i>love</i> you!

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:11.160
Wizard-sama!

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:13.250
Silence, swine.

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:17.750
Wow, Wizard-sama's popularity
is through the roof!

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:17.750
<b>Planet of the Maids</b>

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:19.350
Ozaki-kun!

00:12:19.350 --> 00:12:21.690
But he's doing such horrible things.

00:12:21.690 --> 00:12:26.010
He's evil, but I think people like 
the fact that he's true to himself.

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:27.160
See?

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:29.770
<b>Alpha</b>

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:29.770
<b>Wizard-sama's 
seriously cool</b>

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:30.180
<b>Alpha</b>

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:30.180
<b>Wizard-sama's 
seriously cool</b>

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:31.100
<b>Lazy</b>

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:31.100
<b>Silence, swine.</b>

00:12:31.320 --> 00:12:32.480
Oh, come on...

00:12:31.320 --> 00:12:32.480
Is your heart throbbing?

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:32.480
<b>Gent with specs</b>

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:32.480
<b>I am the Wizard!!!!!!!</b>

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:33.850
<b>Moenyan</b>

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:33.850
<b>[Extra!!] Wizard-sama! 
Is too cool!! 
[Extra!!] Wizard-sama!
 Is too cool!!</b>

00:12:32.840 --> 00:12:33.820
It totally is!

00:12:33.820 --> 00:12:35.750
Throb, throb, throb, throb!

00:12:33.890 --> 00:12:34.310
<b>Girl with glasses</b>

00:12:33.890 --> 00:12:34.310
<b>Wizard-sama!! Wizard-sama!!</b>

00:12:34.390 --> 00:12:35.150
<b>brrr</b>

00:12:34.390 --> 00:12:35.150
<b>Matsu Suguru sucks</b>

00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:38.390
Here you go. Your heartthrob café au lait!

00:12:38.390 --> 00:12:39.650
Thank mew.

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:40.790
<i>Dammit!</i>

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:46.160
Oh, my. Heel, boy, heel!

00:12:52.980 --> 00:12:54.160
This is it.

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:56.420
I can use this to bring
the Wizard's popularity down.

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:58.980
I won't let you do as you please!

00:12:58.980 --> 00:12:59.920
<b>Mwahaha</b>

00:13:00.590 --> 00:13:02.790
You're all bark and no bite.

00:13:02.790 --> 00:13:05.300
The only one who can stop me is me!

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:07.470
We'll see about that! Go...

00:13:08.360 --> 00:13:11.810
<b>Bam</b>

00:13:09.340 --> 00:13:10.550
Darbobble!

00:13:10.550 --> 00:13:11.810
This is mutting to me!

00:13:12.650 --> 00:13:15.190
Nullify his hold on everyone!

00:13:16.030 --> 00:13:17.810
I'm awake!

00:13:18.160 --> 00:13:19.560
How do you like that, Wizard?

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:21.220
Wait, what?

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:27.380
<b>Run</b>

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:27.380
<b>Run</b>

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:27.380
<b>Run</b>

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:27.380
<b>Run</b>

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:27.700
I can't handle dogs! Help me, please!

00:13:28.830 --> 00:13:31.200
How about all this Wizard merch?

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:34.340
But why is there even Wizard merch?!

00:13:34.340 --> 00:13:35.850
Well, you see...

00:13:35.850 --> 00:13:37.680
People loved him running from the dog.

00:13:37.680 --> 00:13:40.390
His popularity has skyrocketed even further!

00:13:40.390 --> 00:13:42.590
Wizard-sama's so cute!

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:45.040
I'm going to go for the jugular next time.

00:13:45.040 --> 00:13:46.590
Huh? What?

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:48.220
<i>Even more evil...</i>

00:13:52.360 --> 00:13:56.670
Not losing official matches is one thing,
but he doesn't even lose scrimmages.

00:13:56.670 --> 00:13:58.980
That's his fifth goal today.

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:00.680
He doesn't hold back.

00:14:00.680 --> 00:14:02.830
Dammit! These mittens!

00:14:02.830 --> 00:14:04.910
Mittens! Mittens!

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:07.360
Ozaki again?

00:14:07.750 --> 00:14:09.770
He's been coming here every day.

00:14:09.770 --> 00:14:12.990
He must have a lot of time on his hands. 
He doesn't do any club activities.

00:14:13.570 --> 00:14:16.350
Don't you think he looks livid?

00:14:16.350 --> 00:14:18.500
His face always looks like that.

00:14:18.890 --> 00:14:19.580
Aoy...

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:24.630
...ue Wizard! I will never accept 
your evil existence!

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:28.790
If you think all I can do is 
control people, you're mistaken!

00:14:29.900 --> 00:14:33.110
I have never lost a fight!

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:36.100
Blue Punish!

00:14:38.180 --> 00:14:40.100
The town's in danger!

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:42.110
Puh-Puh-Puh-Punish!

00:14:43.960 --> 00:14:45.110
<b>Boom</b>

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:51.990
The world has gotten
a little bit cleaner again.

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:55.950
<b>Results of the second "I'm Going to 
Save This World!!" popularity contest!!</b>

00:14:52.670 --> 00:14:55.950
Here are the results
 of the popularity contest!

00:14:55.950 --> 00:15:00.540
<b>place</b>

00:14:55.950 --> 00:15:00.540
<b>votes</b>

00:14:55.950 --> 00:15:00.540
<b>Blue Wizard</b>

00:14:56.520 --> 00:15:00.540
In first place with 8,531 votes: Wizard!

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:06.380
<b>Matsu Suguru</b>

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:06.380
<b>Darbobble</b>

00:15:01.140 --> 00:15:06.380
In second place: Matsu Suguru 
with 2245 votes. Third, Darbobble.

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:09.480
Wizard-sama's so good!

00:15:09.480 --> 00:15:12.390
Let me see this week's Wizard already!

00:15:14.910 --> 00:15:18.060
<i>So be it! He'll become the ultimate evil...</i>

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:21.690
<b>Big Bang</b>

00:15:19.050 --> 00:15:21.690
...and vanish along with the entire planet!

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:23.560
Ozaki-kun...

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:29.570
<b>I'm Going to 
Save This World!!</b>

00:15:24.100 --> 00:15:27.080
No destroying the planet.

00:15:27.080 --> 00:15:28.630
Otherwise, nobody can save the world.

00:15:28.630 --> 00:15:29.570
But...

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:30.830
Rejected.

00:15:32.710 --> 00:15:34.410
Then, how about this?

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:42.540
All the women of the world are mine!

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:49.170
Gonz

00:15:45.860 --> 00:15:49.170
Ozaki-kun, I have bad news
about this week's chapter.

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:52.300
<b>I'm Going to 
Save This World!!</b>

00:15:50.280 --> 00:15:52.300
Its popularity is in free fall.

00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:58.490
The female fan base has reacted very badly
to seeing the Wizard be a playboy.

00:15:59.250 --> 00:16:01.310
This is bad.

00:16:01.710 --> 00:16:04.520
So you mean Wizard's popularity
has plummeted?

00:16:04.520 --> 00:16:05.780
Yes.

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:10.850
There it is! I finally did it!

00:16:10.850 --> 00:16:13.070
Take that, Wizard!

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:18.330
Ozaki-kun, do you realize
 what you're saying?

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:23.330
<b>I'm Going to 
Save This World!!</b>

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:23.330
This might be your manga,
but it's also a product of our company.

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:26.080
This isn't a hobby or a game.

00:16:27.510 --> 00:16:28.580
Ozaki-kun.

00:16:29.040 --> 00:16:34.020
With an anime on the way,
we cannot let the series tank.

00:16:35.420 --> 00:16:36.840
Hey, Aoyama!

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:39.980
You don't need that for practice!

00:16:41.220 --> 00:16:45.230
<b>Gonz</b>

00:16:41.660 --> 00:16:45.230
<i>A </i>Gonz<i>? Is he following the series, too?</i>

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:47.420
This is four eyes-san's.

00:16:47.420 --> 00:16:49.110
<i>It's ironic.</i>

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:53.970
<b>Blue Wizard</b>

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:53.970
<b>Matsu Suguru</b>

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:54.270
<i>The wizard who's modeled on Aoyama 
has totally usurped the main character.</i>

00:16:55.290 --> 00:16:58.090
Satou-san was saying something
about mittens, wasn't he?

00:16:58.090 --> 00:16:58.990
Don't ask me!

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:04.190
Anyway, regaining Wizard-sama's 
popularity is priority number one.

00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:08.860
I'm a genius manga author!

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:11.140
This is a piece of cake!

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:12.400
<b>I'm Going
 to Save 
This World!!</b>

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:16.510
Today's the day I will finally beat you!

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:22.890
Garudo Death Gold!

00:17:23.620 --> 00:17:24.410
<b>Boom</b>

00:17:25.390 --> 00:17:31.400
<b>Whoosh</b>

00:17:26.300 --> 00:17:30.420
The ruler of this world 
won't be that wizard!

00:17:30.420 --> 00:17:31.420
What?!

00:17:31.420 --> 00:17:32.600
It'll be me,

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:38.180
Garudo-sama!

00:17:38.180 --> 00:17:39.410
Matsu Suguru.

00:17:40.360 --> 00:17:44.320
Shall we momentarily
 put our fight on hold?

00:17:44.320 --> 00:17:46.540
I don't like that muscle head.

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:48.920
You want me to team up with you?

00:17:49.310 --> 00:17:50.590
It's decided, then.

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:53.190
It's a temporary truce.

00:17:54.990 --> 00:17:59.020
<i>How's that? The rivals are teaming 
up in this heated encounter!</i>

00:17:59.020 --> 00:18:00.840
<i>Love it! Love it!</i>

00:18:03.230 --> 00:18:04.680
They jumped the shark.

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:09.140
The author just doesn't get it.

00:18:09.550 --> 00:18:14.650
It doesn't make any sense for Wizard-sama 
to team up with that loser, Suguru!

00:18:15.080 --> 00:18:16.570
<i>Suguru, a loser?</i>

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:19.400
I bet it's just an attempt to 
recapture the female fan base

00:18:19.400 --> 00:18:21.940
after Wizard-sama made
all those women wait on him.

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:25.180
<i>You people know nothing!</i>

00:18:25.180 --> 00:18:28.020
<i>I'm going to take your oh-so-important 
reader opinion to heart</i>

00:18:28.020 --> 00:18:30.750
<i>and make you choke on your words!</i>

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:32.750
<b>Roar</b>

00:18:36.060 --> 00:18:37.260
Wizard!

00:18:38.030 --> 00:18:39.570
I'm fine!

00:18:39.570 --> 00:18:41.260
What? You're tiny!

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:43.140
I'm tired.

00:18:43.860 --> 00:18:46.270
Don't die! Not on my shoulder!

00:18:47.450 --> 00:18:51.700
<i>What do you think, girls?! 
Isn't mini Wizard super cute?!</i>

00:18:51.700 --> 00:18:53.740
<i>Love it! Love it!</i>

00:18:54.550 --> 00:18:56.580
What is this? It's horrible!

00:18:57.290 --> 00:19:01.650
The shrunken Wizard-sama's going to die!

00:19:01.650 --> 00:19:05.290
<i>What? That was supposed to be funny!</i>

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:07.410
I can't read this!

00:19:08.390 --> 00:19:11.040
<i>Dammit! What will make them happy?!</i>

00:19:11.350 --> 00:19:13.240
<i>No, believe in yourself!</i>

00:19:13.240 --> 00:19:15.300
<i>If I put all of my
manga-writing powers into it,</i>

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:17.770
<i>I can recover the series' popularity!</i>

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:23.050
<b>I will protect you!</b>

00:19:17.230 --> 00:19:23.240
<b>Bomb</b>

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:22.120
What happened to his phobia of dogs?

00:19:23.240 --> 00:19:29.540
<b>Badump</b>

00:19:23.300 --> 00:19:29.100
<b>Su-gu-ru</b>

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:29.630
So last year! Is this author stupid?!

00:19:29.630 --> 00:19:33.050
For you, I'd gladly lay down my life!

00:19:33.050 --> 00:19:35.700
Who even are you?

00:19:37.450 --> 00:19:39.190
<i>Wizard. Wizard.</i>

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:42.440
He doesn't get it. He doesn't get it.

00:19:42.440 --> 00:19:44.540
Is the author dumb?

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:47.780
<i>I don't know what's right
and what's wrong anymore,</i>

00:19:47.780 --> 00:19:50.460
<i>even though I'm the one who created Wizard.</i>

00:19:52.190 --> 00:19:54.460
<i>He reads the series, too!</i>

00:19:54.870 --> 00:19:56.960
<i>I'm going to ask him directly!</i>

00:19:56.960 --> 00:19:59.960
<i>Oh, that's this week's issue!</i>

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:02.430
<i>The next page is </i>I'm Going to Save This World!!<i></i>

00:20:02.430 --> 00:20:03.700
<i>Read it already!</i>

00:20:03.700 --> 00:20:05.220
<i>Turn the page!</i>

00:20:05.360 --> 00:20:08.350
<b>I'm Going to 
Save This World!!</b>

00:20:06.050 --> 00:20:07.460
<i>At last!</i>

00:20:10.550 --> 00:20:11.850
Aoyama!

00:20:12.670 --> 00:20:14.600
Did you read this week's <i>Gonz</i>?

00:20:14.600 --> 00:20:15.760
Huh?

00:20:15.760 --> 00:20:18.280
Why is Ozaki in a freshman classroom?

00:20:18.280 --> 00:20:19.610
Weirdo.

00:20:19.610 --> 00:20:23.260
You! Why did you skip 
<i>I'm Going to Save This World!!</i>?

00:20:24.060 --> 00:20:27.240
Isn't it obvious if you're a fan?

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:30.830
Lately, Wizard-sama's such 
a tool, it's unbearable.

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:32.620
Especially to true fans.

00:20:32.620 --> 00:20:34.890
True love is skipping reading it!

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:39.380
<i>I can't do it. I can't do it by myself.</i>

00:20:39.740 --> 00:20:43.130
<i>To write Wizard... to do that...</i>

00:20:44.150 --> 00:20:48.060
<i>I need your help, Aoyama!</i>

00:20:48.060 --> 00:20:48.930
Um...

00:20:50.330 --> 00:20:52.420
I skipped <i>I'm Going to Save This World!!</i>

00:20:53.500 --> 00:20:54.730
because I don't read it.

00:20:57.900 --> 00:21:00.570
I don't like the art style.

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:03.810
<i>Why, you!</i>

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:04.780
<b>Boom</b>

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:06.510
Bastard!

00:21:07.970 --> 00:21:10.160
I thought we were putting our fight on hold!

00:21:10.160 --> 00:21:16.290
You ugly stain! I'm the hell-fiend
of the wizarding world, Blue Wizard!

00:21:16.650 --> 00:21:20.420
Trusting me means 
something's wrong with you!

00:21:20.420 --> 00:21:24.100
Come forth, Evil Azure Orb!

00:21:24.920 --> 00:21:27.550
Blue-Blue Punish!

00:21:24.920 --> 00:21:27.550
<b>Zoom</b>

00:21:27.990 --> 00:21:29.800
You traitor!

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:33.620
<b>Boom</b>

00:21:35.610 --> 00:21:36.810
So noble.

00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:42.610
This is it! This is the revival 
of Wizard-sama we wanted!

00:21:44.920 --> 00:21:46.820
You've all got a screw loose.

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:27.410
Ah!

00:23:28.990 --> 00:23:30.050
So close!

00:23:34.050 --> 00:23:37.060
<b>Aoyama Life</b>

00:23:37.060 --> 00:23:41.500
<b>Next episode</b>

00:23:37.060 --> 00:23:41.500
<b>Odagiri-san Can't Get It In</b>
